# Artifacts policy:
# Upload ALL verification logs, benchmark JSONs, diagnostic reports, and 1 compact (3.66 MB) reference .pt
# Skip redundant multi-epoch smoke .pt checkpoints (>50 MB combined)
artifacts/*.pt
!artifacts/mirror7_native_conversation_v5_ep5.best.pt
